        "detail": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\"><div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\"><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;text-align:left;color:rgb(67, 70, 73)\" class=\"word-break white-space mt-10\" align=\"left\">Brand: PGM<br/>Material: wood<br/>Golf TEE Golf Tee Golf Holder<br/>(Wood Tee) Specifications:<br/>42mm【0.8g】; 54mm【0.9g】<br/>70mm【0.9g】</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left\" class=\"word-break white-space mt-10\" align=\"left\">Product Advantages</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;text-align:left;color:rgb(67, 70, 73)\" class=\"word-break white-space mt-10\" align=\"left\">Strong Bamboo Construction: Crafted from high-strength bamboo, these tees deliver reliable performance and help you achieve consistent shots every time you play.<br/><br/>Protect Your Clubs: The smooth finish and natural tensile strength of bamboo minimize club marks, ensuring a clean, damage-free impact with every swing.<br/><br/>Enhanced Accuracy and Distance: Engineered to reduce friction and side spin, these tees help optimize your shot distance and accuracy for longer, straighter drives.<br/><br/>Bright colors:Make it more fun,The color golf tees can be easily spotted after you hit.</p><div><img style=\"width:100%;height:auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sb7344f06be894952b9fa9de04c53291fY.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/> <img style=\"width:100%;height:auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S3f754a106e3a48b3a7f6f756eadcfb42O.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/> <img style=\"width:100%;height:auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sdbbc02a540a74612b4a0872e34e8fae7Z.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/> <img style=\"width:100%;height:auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S3c7e2723b05443488f9246f63ddf2c03F.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/> <img style=\"width:100%;height:auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S3064bd6a062540eb94baf9626eda74d2k.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/> <img style=\"width:100%;height:auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S95580f35bf3941e98d55dd2cb752eb5cr.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/></div></div></div><p><br/></p>"
